ght": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "t145", "x": 576, "y": 286, "width": 142.79999999999998, "height": 87.5, "text": "核心层恒定的前缀 + 变化层做尾巴\n= 前缀缓存命中 + 相关工具命中\n\n稳定层字节不变是命中的前提，\n变化的只能是尾部", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "originalText": "核心层恒定的前缀 + 变化层做尾巴\n= 前缀缓存命中 + 相关工具命中\n\n稳定层字节不变是命中的前提，\n变化的只能是尾部", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "r146", "x": 40, "y": 480, "width": 1160, "height": 124, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "opacity": 100}, {"type": "text", "id": "t147", "x": 56, "y": 490, "width": 48.0, "height": 20.0, "text": "质量软降级", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "originalText": "质量软降级", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "r148", "x": 56, "y": 524, "width": 360, "height": 74, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeStyle": "solid", "opacity": 100, "boundElements": [{"id": "t149", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "text", "id": "t149", "x": 66, "y": 551.9, "width": 340, "height": 48.75, "text": "运行时质量评分\n成功率 / 耗时 / 审批率\n= 0.5 / 0.3 / 0.2", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "r148", "originalText": "运行时质量评分\n成功率 / 耗时 / 审批率\n= 0.5 / 0.3 / 0.2", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "r150", "x": 430, "y": 524, "width": 380, "height": 74, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeStyle": "solid", "opacity": 100, "boundElements": [{"id": "t151", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "text", "id": "t151", "x": 440, "y": 551.9, "width": 360, "height": 48.75, "text": "连续窗口 50 · 阈值 0.4\n低分工具退出「变层」候选\n淘汰是渐进的，不突变", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "r150", "originalText": "连续窗口 50 · 阈值 0.4\n低分工具退出「变层」候选\n淘汰是渐进的，不突变", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "r152", "x": 824, "y": 524, "width": 360, "height": 74, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeStyle": "solid", "opacity": 100, "boundElements": [{"id": "t153", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "text", "id": "t153", "x": 834, "y": 551.9, "width": 340, "height": 48.75, "text": "软降级 ≠ 禁用\nschema 仍可见、仍可调用\n权限模型不动", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#8a6d00", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "r152", "originalText": "软降级 ≠ 禁用\nschema 仍可见、仍可调用\n权限模型不动", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "gridSize": null}}